  "value": 200,
  "description": "\ud83d\udcd6 Scenario\r\n\r\nThe application provides a proxy functionality intended to retrieve remote resources.\r\n\r\nHowever, the application may not properly restrict where the server can make requests.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Mission\r\n\r\nInvestigate the proxy functionality at:\r\n\r\nhttp://flag.cgcybercom.online\r\n\r\nDetermine whether the server can access a service bound only to the local interface.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Objective\r\n\r\nAccess the internal service containing the flag.\r\n\r\nSubmit only the required answer using the flag format: pcgCTF{answer}\r\n",
